# Introduction and Motivation

* Big Data and Traditional AI
- @Background@: focus for past 10 years
  - Collect and organize massive data volumes
  - Run analytics (dashboards, models, reports) on data

- @Definition@: **Data Analytics** encompasses organized data and insights

